[ti:A Small Blue Case]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.57]Lesson 97 | 第97课
[00:02.83]A small blue case | 一个蓝色的小箱子
[00:07.03]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.79]Does Mr. Hall get his case back? | 霍尔先生拿回他的箱子了吗?
[00:18.40]I left a suitcase on the train to London the other day. | 几天前,我把一个手提箱忘在了去伦敦的火车上。
[00:24.39]Can you describe it, sir? | 先生,您能描述一下吗?
[00:27.81]It's a small blue case and it's got a zip. | 是一个蓝色的小箱子,带拉链。
[00:34.27]There's a label on the handle with my name and address on it. | 把手上有一个标签,上面有我的名字和地址。
[00:40.41]Is this case yours? | 这个箱子是您的吗?
[00:43.14]No, that's not mine. | 不,那不是我的。
[00:45.83]What about this one? | 这个呢?
[00:48.25]This one's got a label. | 这个箱子上有标签。
[00:51.51]Let me see it. | 让我看看。
[00:53.98]What's your name and address? | 您的姓名和地址是什么?
[00:57.50]David Hall, 83, Bridge Street. | 戴维·霍尔,大桥街83号。
[01:02.64]That's right. | 没错。
[01:04.14]D. N. Hall, 83, Bridge Street. | D. N. 霍尔,大桥街83号。
[01:09.99]Three pounds fifty pence, please. | 请付3英镑50便士。
[01:13.69]Here you are. | 给你。
[01:15.52]Thank you. | 谢谢你。
[01:16.89]Hey! | 嘿!
[01:18.11]What's the matter? | 怎么了?
[01:20.09]This case doesn't belong to me! | 这个箱子不是我的!
[01:24.56]You've given me the wrong case! | 你给错箱子了!